{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">PUT-BITS statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310414","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PUT-BITS-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PUT-BITS-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"PUT-BITS-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">PUT-BITS statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Uses the bit representation of an integer to\nset a given number of bits at a given location within another integer.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PUT-BITS-statement__syntax_GC1A11J2700832\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d361166e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PUT-BITS-statement__idGDO2S42674995\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>PUT-BITS ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">numbits</var> ) = <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An ABL integer variable. The statement sets bits in <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> that\ncorrespond to the bits that are on in the source variable, <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>.\nIt clears bits in the destination variable that are 0 in the source\nvariable. Note that the number of bits set or cleared is limited\nby the <var class=\"keyword varname\">numbits</var> parameter, and the location within\nthe destination is determined by the <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> variable.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A variable or expression that returns an integer. This parameter designates\nthe position of the lowest-order bit of the bits that are to be interpreted\nas an integer. Bits are numbered from 1 through the length of an\ninteger; with 1 being the low-order bit. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is\ngreater than the length of an integer or less than 1, the AVM generates\na run-time error.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">numbits</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The number of bits to examine when generating the return value.\nIf <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> plus <var class=\"keyword varname\">numbits</var> is greater\nthan the length of an integer plus 1, the AVM generates a run-time error.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A source variable that returns an integer. If the integer cannot\nbe represented in the number of bits specified by numbits, the AVM\nstores the low-order numbits bits of the integer.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PUT-BITS-statement__see-also_GC1A11K2700851\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d361166e205\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-BITS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-BITS-function.html\">GET-BITS function</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-statement.html\">PUT statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUT-BYTE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-BYTE-statement.html\">PUT-BYTE statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310414","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"PUT-BITS statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-BITS-statement.html","type":"Manual"}